OL,3,GNEWSAWoman still hoping to find pendant
OL,4,Alost in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was evacuated from a
OL,7,Fseafront hotel after a fire broke out
OL,8,Fsays getting a sentimental pendant back
OL,9,Fwould "mean the world" to her.
OL,11,FLeona McMullen, 37, was celebrating her
OL,12,F10th anniversary with her husband at
OL,13,Fthe Grand Burstin Hotel in Folkestone,
OL,14,FKent, in the early hours of 19
OL,15,FSeptember when it was evacuated.
OL,17,FAfter arranging to pick up her
OL,18,Fbelongings on Wednesday, McMullen, from
OL,19,FDartford, said her heart sank when she
OL,20,Frealised a gold chain and doll pendant
OL,21,Fin memory of her grandmother were not
OL,22,Famong her possessions.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
