OL,3,GNEWSAWoman still hoping to find pendant
OL,4,Alost in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "I just want to know that it
OL,7,Fis still in the hotel, or if not, then
OL,8,Fknow where it is. It would mean the
OL,9,Fworld to get them back, I would have no
OL,10,Fwords."
